<title>UK: DG Hyp sets 1.0 billion mark 10-year Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>DG Hyp sets 1.0 billion mark 10-year Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers DG Bank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DG HYP</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    22.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.425    PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.50 BP  LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   22.50 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 758</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
